sequenceDiagram
    participant WF as Workflow Service
    participant KYC as KYC Service
    participant KYCVendor as KYC Vendor SDK
    participant DB as KYC DB
    participant Outbox as Transactional Outbox
    participant Kafka as Event Bus (Kafka)

    WF->>KYC: Initiate KYC verification
    KYC->>KYCVendor: Start PAN verification
    KYCVendor-->>KYC: PAN verified
    KYC->>KYCVendor: Request Aadhaar verification
    KYCVendor-->>KYC: Aadhaar verified (live, in-memory only)
    KYC->>KYCVendor: Request face match/liveness
    KYCVendor-->>KYC: Face match successful (image discarded)
    
    Note over KYC: Store ONLY KYC status, not Aadhaar or face image
    
    KYC->>DB: Persist KYC verification result
    KYC->>Outbox: Write KYC_VERIFIED event to outbox
    DB-->>KYC: Commit transaction (state + event)
    KYC->>Kafka: Publish KYC_VERIFIED event
    Kafka-->>WF: Event consumed
    WF-->>WF: Proceed to income verification